  "body": "Found reviewing #1165 (sinker EDM machine setup page). The Machine window's sinker condition table edits the gap and undersize but cannot edit a condition's `wear` rate (#1157) or `notes`. Both are kept unchanged on save, and a bad wear rate is flagged, but a user cannot enter or correct a wear rate in the GUI; it has to be written into the machine file by hand.\n\n**Done means:** the condition table has wear-rate and notes columns, edited through the existing undoable `EditMachineApply`, with the wear-rate checks from #1157 (finite, >= 0, within the stated bound) refusing bad values by name. A structural UI test covers the new inputs.\n",
